# The image build context is the WaaV ROOT (gateway/Cargo.toml has path deps on sibling
# crates), so this file — not gateway/.dockerignore — is what keeps the context small.
# Without it the context includes every crate's target/, which is tens of gigabytes.
**/target/
target/
*.rlib
*.rmeta

.git/
.github/
dist/
node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Docs, research notes and media that never enter the image.
docs/
examples/
assets/
clients_sdk/
*.md
!gateway/README.md
